This project uses s3lab-ai-kit standards. Full kit lives in `.ai-kit/` (git submodule).

Source of truth (read on demand):
- `.ai-kit/ai/core.md` — imports all conventions
- `.ai-kit/ai/conventions/` — per-technology rules
- `.ai-kit/ai/agents/` — specialized persona prompts
- `.ai-kit/ai/commands/` — full pipelines (feature, bugfix, ...)
- `.ai/project-context.md` — this project's specifics

