## Hard rules

- Never commit secrets. Use `.env` (gitignored) and `.env.example` (committed).
- Never edit generated code: OpenAPI clients, applied EF migrations, protobuf stubs.
- Backend changes API → update OpenAPI → regenerate frontend client. No hand-rolled HTTP calls.
- Plan before code on non-trivial work. Read `.ai-kit/ai/agents/orchestrator.md` first.
